{"id":"0ef447c86630ad39","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Skolem Hull Ordinal","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Skolem Hull Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Skolem Hull Ordinal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Skolem Hull Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0494a2630c9bee7c\" href=\"?note=0494a2630c9bee7c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,A,\\alpha,H,\\mathcal S,K,f,\\bar a,\\xi\\in V\">\\(M,A,\\alpha,H,\\mathcal S,K,f,\\bar a,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0494a2630c9bee7c\" href=\"?note=0494a2630c9bee7c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (auxiliary predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SkolemHullOrdinal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SkolemHullOrdinal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M,\\mathcal S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M)\n\\land A\\subseteq H\\subseteq M\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H)\n\\land\\forall K\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq K\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in K^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in K)\n\\to H\\subseteq K\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M,\\mathcal S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M)\n\\land A\\subseteq H\\subseteq M\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H)\n\\land\\forall K\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq K\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in K^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in K)\n\\to H\\subseteq K\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SkolemHullOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,A,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\xi\\in H:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SkolemHullOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,A,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\xi\\in H:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hull is the least subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and closed under a declared Skolem-function family.</li>\n<li>The ordinal height uses a bounded set comprehension instead of intersecting with the proper class of all ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi