ar a)\\in K)\n\\to H\\subseteq K\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SkolemHullOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,A,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\xi\\in H:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1906,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3020","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-skolem-hull-ordinal]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0494a2630c9bee7c","5582a281f15a33c2"]}